WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.635
-♪ 1, 2, 3, think fast ♪

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:03.737
[ Applause ]

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:05.004
-Ooh!

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.539
-That is the fastest theme song
we've ever had.

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:07.873
-It's fast.
-Yeah, it's very, very fast.

00:00:07.873 --> 00:00:08.942
-"Think Fast." I got it.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.243
-Yeah,
here's how it works, okay?

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.011
We're going to take turns
drawing one of these cards.

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:14.881
Each card has five
totally random questions on it.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:17.116
One person asks the question,
the other person

00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:20.186
has to answer each question
as soon as it's asked,

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.588
and I mean immediately.
-Immediately.

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:23.523
-Doesn't matter if the answer
is right or wrong.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.191
It just has to be
the very first thing...

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:26.326
[ Laughter ]
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:28.628
-...that pops into your head.
-Okay.

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:31.331
-Sterling, I'm feeling your --
I'm feeling your vibe right now.

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.533
-Don't want to curse on TV.
That's all I'm thinking about.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:36.669
-You won't do it.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.903
-I won't. I'm ready.
-You're the guest.

00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:39.438
I will read
your questions first.

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:40.907
-Okay.
-And you just answer.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.007
You ready for this?
-Yes.

00:00:42.007 --> 00:00:43.542
-Ooh, lighting change.

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:45.277
[ Audience murmurs ]

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:46.979
Oh, we're "The Tonight Show."
We don't fool around.

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:48.581
[ Laughter ]
-No doubt.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.550
-Phew.
Ready?

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.251
Here we go.
-Go.

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:54.153
-What's the most dangerous
thing to eat?

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:55.722
-Cookies!
-How t--

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:57.890
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:59.191
How tall is your grandson?

00:00:59.191 --> 00:01:00.293
-17.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.994
-[ Laughs ] What?

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:03.396
What is Linda's deal?

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:04.797
-Booties!

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:07.967
-[ Laughing ] Which city
are the seven dwarfs from?

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.235
-Oh, Vermont.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.837
-Yell -- Yell any first name.

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:13.106
-Steven!

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:14.507
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:15.842
[ Bell dings ]

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.844
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:20.146 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:21.614
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:22.848
-Cookies!
-Vermont!

00:01:22.848 --> 00:01:24.817
-Cookies!
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:26.619
-Don't eat the cookies!
Okay.

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.788
-My grammar school
liked geometry,

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.056
not geology.

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:33.059
Oh, what is it called?
Geography! Vermont.

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.494
-Fast is fast.

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:35.695
This is "Think Fast," man.
Here we go.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.030
All right, your turn.
Dim the lights.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.364
-Lighting, please.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.533
[ Cheers ]
Thank you.

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:44.604
Jimmy.
-Yeah.

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:46.505
-What did you text to Trevor?

00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:48.640
-"What's your deal, dude?"

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:50.776
-Why are you relieved?

00:01:50.776 --> 00:01:53.446
-Because the sun shines.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.147
-What's the biggest number?

00:01:55.147 --> 00:01:58.284
-Thirdeen.

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.053
-What is a pig
trying to say when it oinks?

00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:03.590
-[ Laughs ] "Excuse me."

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:04.690
-[ Snorts ]

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:06.693
Show me your angry face!

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:08.728
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:10.430
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:14.233
-13, 30, 13, 30.

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:16.736
I couldn't think --
I couldn't settle on one number.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.070
All right, here we go.
This is last round.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.472
The final round.
-Yes.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:20.739
-In this round,
we'll both pick up a card

00:02:20.739 --> 00:02:22.241
with the same set of questions.

00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:24.677
We'll ask and answer them one
at a time going back and forth.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.078
-Okay.
-Here we go.

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:27.413
-You first?
-I'll go first.

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:29.382
-Okay.

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:30.583
-Ready?
-Ready.

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:32.084
-Which contest did you win?

00:02:32.084 --> 00:02:33.853
-All of them!

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:35.721
What's another word for spoon?

00:02:35.721 --> 00:02:37.256
-Speern.

00:02:37.256 --> 00:02:38.958
What sound does a penguin make?

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:41.160
-[ Whinnies ]

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.262
What is Bart Simpson
doing right now?

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:44.463
-Skateboarding.

00:02:44.463 --> 00:02:45.898
Describe my hair.

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:47.433
-Beautiful.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:49.001
Are you a professional yodeler?

00:02:49.001 --> 00:02:50.904
-Ye-e-e-s.

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:52.972
Who will be President
in the year 2050?

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:55.808
-Oh, God, maybe Oprah.
That would be awesome.

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:57.943
What's Bill Gates' real name?

00:02:57.943 --> 00:02:59.312
-Todd Sampson.

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.780
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.114
How many penguins?

00:03:02.114 --> 00:03:03.415
-37!

00:03:03.415 --> 00:03:04.817
Say something smart.

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:05.951
-Adios.

00:03:05.951 --> 00:03:07.586
[ Laughs ] Oh, my God.

00:03:07.586 --> 00:03:08.854
[ Bell dings ]
-Sterling K. Brown.

00:03:08.854 --> 00:03:10.122
"Think Fast."

00:03:10.122 --> 00:03:12.458
Season finale of "This is Us"
airs this Tuesday

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.060
at 9:00 P.M. on NBC.

